WEBVTT

00:02.580 --> 00:04.670
If there is a god of cosplay...

00:05.460 --> 00:07.080
I'm going to make her...

00:08.880 --> 00:10.290
...smile upon me!

00:12.580 --> 00:13.960
I'm not going down like this!

00:15.330 --> 00:17.580
Not when I finally get it!

00:18.420 --> 00:23.290
Do you see me, Kai-sama?
Look how cute I am now!

00:24.170 --> 00:26.750
Everyone, look at me!

00:27.710 --> 00:29.500
What's happening?

00:29.500 --> 00:34.380
Seems our lovely Liliel has
lit a fire in miss Nagomi's heart.

00:34.380 --> 00:37.540
He's right...
Her crowd just keeps growing!

00:37.830 --> 00:40.170
B-but so is Liliel's!

00:40.580 --> 00:43.880
It's not happening quite as fast,
but her crowd's getting bigger, too!

02:18.000 --> 02:22.960
<b>My Enchanted Armor</b>

02:27.000 --> 02:29.380
This really is incredible.

02:29.380 --> 02:30.130
Eh?

02:30.540 --> 02:32.420
You may not know this...

02:32.750 --> 02:35.920
And Miss Liliel herself may not know this herself.

02:35.920 --> 02:38.580
Many components contribute
to photographers forming a crowd:

02:38.580 --> 02:44.710
the character's popularity, the cosplayer's fame,
skimpiness, but there's skill to it, too.

02:45.250 --> 02:51.000
And if photographers stay in the crowd,
then the crowd will continue to grow, obviously.

02:51.000 --> 02:53.330
Well, yeah, that is kinda obvious.

02:53.920 --> 02:57.670
The trick, then, is to never let
a photographer want to leave!

02:58.210 --> 03:00.790
You're still here?
You were here when she started.

03:00.790 --> 03:03.500
Yeah, but like...

03:03.500 --> 03:07.130
She just keeps them coming.
I don't know when to stop.

03:07.130 --> 03:10.580
Look! Another good pose! She's so cute!

03:11.170 --> 03:16.290
Miss Liliel's strength is her massive
inventory of poses and expressions!

03:17.040 --> 03:20.170
It's hard to come up with poses on the fly.

03:20.710 --> 03:25.290
Most newbies might have
five to ten poses in their repertoire.

03:25.880 --> 03:27.920
But look at our Liliel...

03:29.130 --> 03:31.040
I don't have enough time for everything!

03:31.040 --> 03:33.960
Oh, right, I should do a pose from that one scene!

03:33.960 --> 03:37.380
Gotta keep going. I've only got...

03:38.210 --> 03:40.080
...a thousand more poses to do!

03:40.080 --> 03:42.290
<b>WHOOOOOAAA!</b>

03:40.080 --> 03:42.330
That's from that famous cover art!

03:42.330 --> 03:46.960
Miss Liliel can faithfully reproduce
scenes from the manga and anime!

03:46.960 --> 03:48.130
That's right!

03:48.130 --> 03:51.080
And that means she doesn't need
to come up with poses on the fly.

03:51.080 --> 03:55.670
Between the anime, the spinoff, and the manga,
there are tons of scenes to pick from.

03:55.670 --> 03:58.170
And Ririsa has them all memorized!

03:58.960 --> 04:01.880
This moment was a huge deal in the manga.

04:01.880 --> 04:03.830
I want everyone to see this!

04:03.830 --> 04:05.080
Whoa!

04:05.080 --> 04:06.080
Amazing!

04:06.080 --> 04:08.630
I was so focused on the Queens
I didn't notice she was here!

04:09.790 --> 04:11.460
It just keeps going...

04:12.630 --> 04:14.250
Miss Liliel has a unique skill...

04:14.670 --> 04:18.080
The skill to keep photographers glued to their spot!

04:18.080 --> 04:20.710
I may need to get some photos of my own!

04:23.420 --> 04:25.830
Okay, I'm going in, too!

04:29.170 --> 04:33.630
So many people are here to see my cosplay.

04:34.330 --> 04:38.670
It's nerve-wracking.
And scary, too, with all the flashes going off.

04:39.750 --> 04:43.130
But, I'm so happy.

04:44.250 --> 04:46.330
I love this so much.

04:47.000 --> 04:48.670
I've worked so hard on this.

04:51.580 --> 04:53.790
Now I know it wasn't a waste!

04:56.500 --> 04:59.130
Thank you, Nagomi-san.

04:59.790 --> 05:02.630
You helped me realize something truly important.

05:03.040 --> 05:07.420
You love Liliel, and cosplay is how you show that love.

05:08.210 --> 05:10.290
Here's how I would respond now.

05:10.290 --> 05:13.830
Cosplay might just be the way I show my love for Liliel.

05:13.830 --> 05:16.540
I might only be cosplaying because of her.

05:17.330 --> 05:19.750
But, that's okay.

05:20.500 --> 05:25.500
I was a nerdy otaku who liked sexy outfits.
I always kept that to myself.

05:25.790 --> 05:30.750
But cosplay gave me a place that accepted me,
where I felt safe.

05:31.830 --> 05:35.250
It gave me the courage to be myself.

05:35.960 --> 05:40.380
Which sounds weird,
because it lets me transform into someone else...

05:41.750 --> 05:46.460
Cosplay is like my enchanted armor
that transforms me into my true self.

05:47.290 --> 05:50.210
It's kinda nerdy, but that's how I'd put it.

05:50.960 --> 05:55.330
That's the answer I would give you now, Nagomi-san!

05:56.290 --> 06:02.290
I wrote you off as just another passionate newbie,
but I was wrong, Liliel.

06:03.170 --> 06:05.330
You're the real deal.

06:05.920 --> 06:08.960
Yet weirdly, I don't feel the usual anxiety.

06:08.960 --> 06:11.790
Maybe it's 'cause I remembered how I felt starting off.

06:12.500 --> 06:13.540
No...

06:13.540 --> 06:15.500
I've never felt this comfortable
around another cosplayer.

06:16.750 --> 06:18.750
There's something different about you.

06:21.960 --> 06:26.000
Competing with Mayura was fun.
It got my blood pumping.

06:26.540 --> 06:27.580
But...

06:28.750 --> 06:32.000
Competing with you feels good, Liliel.

06:32.000 --> 06:34.830
It feels like we shine brighter together.

06:35.580 --> 06:37.920
I didn't think I could feel this way about a rival.

06:38.290 --> 06:41.670
Wait. Did I just call you a rival?

06:42.330 --> 06:44.790
Oh, whatever.

06:46.790 --> 06:49.790
I'm sure we'll be rivals soon enough.

06:51.630 --> 06:53.000
I heard there were two Queens here!

06:53.000 --> 06:55.040
Nah, Mayura-sama left already.

06:55.040 --> 06:57.420
What?! Then what's this crowd next to Nagomi's?

06:57.420 --> 06:58.790
Some new girl!

06:58.790 --> 07:00.460
This awesome newbie!

07:00.460 --> 07:01.710
Who is she? What's going on?

07:01.710 --> 07:03.500
I dunno, but who cares?

07:05.830 --> 07:08.000
She's a really cute Liliel!

07:31.170 --> 07:35.710
This is crazy, bro.
You only see this kinda excitement at Comiket.

07:35.710 --> 07:38.040
Don't you need to get pictures of your client?

07:38.040 --> 07:40.540
I gotta get pictures of the venue, too.

07:41.250 --> 07:42.960
Damn, though...

07:42.960 --> 07:47.540
People were hype about seeing Nagomi and Mayura,

07:47.540 --> 07:50.000
but they're still just as hype for this girl.

07:50.000 --> 07:51.960
I'm gonna make her famous!

07:51.960 --> 07:53.210
I'm gonna make her go viral!

07:53.960 --> 07:57.580
That Liliel cosplayer could be the next Queen.

08:00.670 --> 08:03.170
I wish this moment could last forever...

08:04.880 --> 08:05.960
But it can't.

08:06.790 --> 08:09.000
I've got to be a professional.

08:10.210 --> 08:12.130
This was a fantastic event.

08:22.960 --> 08:23.920
Nagomi!

08:23.920 --> 08:24.540
...Nagomi!

08:24.540 --> 08:25.790
Thank you!

08:30.250 --> 08:30.790
Sorry-

08:30.790 --> 08:31.880
Nagomi-san.

08:32.790 --> 08:37.130
Nagomi-san, I know you just said
you weren't acting like a real professional.

08:37.750 --> 08:39.040
But...

08:39.040 --> 08:45.000
THIS is the cosplayer I wanted
to work with so badly back then.

08:45.880 --> 08:47.170
Nagomi-san...

08:52.380 --> 08:53.670
Thanks.

08:54.460 --> 08:56.250
Let's get back to the job.

08:56.710 --> 08:57.750
Please...

08:58.290 --> 09:00.290
You've already been working hard.

09:02.250 --> 09:05.960
Cosplay Stream 55 will be closing soon.

09:06.420 --> 09:08.330
Cosplayers, please head to the changing rooms.

09:06.420 --> 09:08.330
Thank you, everyone!

09:08.330 --> 09:10.380
Cosplayers, please head to the changing rooms.

09:08.330 --> 09:10.380
Thank you, miss!

09:14.460 --> 09:16.630
O-okay, I'm gonna go...

09:16.630 --> 09:18.750
Wait, Liliel-chan!

09:18.750 --> 09:20.330
Can I send you my pics?!

09:20.330 --> 09:22.000
Do you have a card or socials?!

09:22.000 --> 09:24.290
My eyes hurt and my makeup is dying!

09:24.290 --> 09:26.790
If I stop to talk,
Liliel's gonna fall apart!

09:27.330 --> 09:30.000
S-sorry!

09:30.330 --> 09:33.330
She disappeared on us once again...

09:33.580 --> 09:35.330
What is she, Cinderella?

09:35.330 --> 09:40.790
Eh, it's okay.
It doesn't matter who she is, really.

09:41.250 --> 09:45.830
She's left us with her glass slipper:
some great photos.

09:46.210 --> 09:48.630
Damn, you're so cool, bro.

09:48.630 --> 09:50.170
Don't I know it.

09:56.380 --> 09:57.130
Nice job!

09:57.130 --> 09:57.750
Senpai!

09:57.750 --> 09:58.960
I got some great pics of you!

10:00.420 --> 10:02.630
Li... Lili...

10:04.920 --> 10:06.210
I'm so sorry!

10:06.210 --> 10:07.960
Uh... you're good.

10:08.210 --> 10:10.330
I'm so glad it went okay,

10:10.330 --> 10:13.580
when I saw your face,
I felt so relieved...

10:13.580 --> 10:15.920
But, but I just...

10:17.040 --> 10:21.630
I-I'm so sorry! I'm really sorry!

10:24.500 --> 10:27.130
Don't worry about what happened earlier.

10:29.830 --> 10:31.330
Remember, in manga,

10:31.330 --> 10:34.420
the protagonist always finds
their way out of trouble.

10:35.080 --> 10:38.540
Today you were the main character of that story.

10:40.170 --> 10:42.630
You were awesome out there, Ririsa!

10:43.540 --> 10:44.920
Senpai...

10:52.540 --> 10:54.880
Thank you... Thank you so much!

10:52.540 --> 10:54.880
Guess my work here is done.

10:54.880 --> 10:55.960
Thank you... Thank you so much!

10:55.960 --> 10:58.460
Can't believe I got to cosplay again...

11:03.790 --> 11:04.880
Mayuri!

11:05.960 --> 11:07.040
Eri?!

11:08.040 --> 11:09.710
I-I didn't know you were here.

11:09.710 --> 11:10.580
Mayuri!

11:14.830 --> 11:16.170
<b>DIVINE GUT BUSTER</b>

11:16.170 --> 11:16.540
<b>DIVINE GUT BUSTER</b>

11:16.170 --> 11:16.540
<b>Dash</b>

11:17.710 --> 11:22.080
You still always react by blocking low.

11:22.080 --> 11:24.460
That dashing mid attack is so OP...

11:24.920 --> 11:27.420
Why did you ghost everyone, idiot?!

11:27.710 --> 11:32.580
Why didn't you say you were quitting?
Why didn't you say you were coming?!

11:33.130 --> 11:36.710
Sorry. I didn't know what to say.

11:36.710 --> 11:37.880
You moron!

11:37.880 --> 11:41.000
You didn't need to throw it
all away like that, stupid!

11:41.000 --> 11:44.460
Why do you keep calling me stupid?!
You were so nice to me on the phone!

11:46.040 --> 11:48.500
Because we're friends, dummy!

11:49.040 --> 11:53.630
Even if you stop cosplaying,
it's still the thing that brought us together!

11:54.210 --> 11:57.040
All those experiences,
the good times, the friendship, too!

11:57.460 --> 12:02.130
I didn't like Lustalotte! I liked you, Mayuri!

12:03.670 --> 12:06.880
Cosplay might've been everything to you...

12:07.670 --> 12:10.710
But don't throw away everything else, too!

12:11.920 --> 12:15.460
Eri... I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.

12:15.920 --> 12:17.790
Don't apologize.

12:17.790 --> 12:20.000
Then... Thank you?

12:20.000 --> 12:23.330
No. Don't say anything.

12:26.210 --> 12:27.080
Idiot.

12:28.040 --> 12:29.170
You're so stupid.

12:32.420 --> 12:36.330
<b>Changing Room</b>

12:34.540 --> 12:36.250
H-hey, so...

12:36.330 --> 12:41.670
<b>HUFF HUFF HUFF</b>

12:37.210 --> 12:39.210
I can finally see the amazing details in your costume!

12:39.210 --> 12:41.670
You look JUST like Icola-chan!
You're so cute!

12:41.670 --> 12:44.580
<b>DODODO</b>

12:41.670 --> 12:43.420
Whoa, is this embroidered?!

12:43.420 --> 12:44.630
A-And I can see how goddamn adorable she is!

12:43.420 --> 12:44.630
Whoa, is this embroidered?!

12:44.630 --> 12:46.540
A-And I can see how goddamn adorable she is!

12:44.630 --> 12:46.540
I've never seen this fabric at the store!

12:46.540 --> 12:47.580
A-And I can see how goddamn adorable she is!

12:46.540 --> 12:47.580
It's got some glitter to it, huh?

12:47.580 --> 12:48.960
Dammit!

12:47.580 --> 12:48.960
It's got some glitter to it, huh?

12:49.210 --> 12:51.420
Why'd you pick her Chaos Form?

12:51.420 --> 12:52.960
I love that version of her!

12:52.960 --> 12:53.960
Really?!

12:53.960 --> 12:59.080
She almost went evil trying to get strong,
but right when she was on the edge,

12:59.080 --> 13:01.920
she came back in that new form, like,
it was such an emotional moment!

13:01.920 --> 13:05.710
I know, right?!
Every week I was so worried about her!

13:05.710 --> 13:07.460
But then she got super powerful and came back!

13:07.460 --> 13:14.630
<b>GRRRRR</b>

13:07.460 --> 13:08.750
OMG! Talking with her is fun.

13:07.460 --> 13:08.750
But then she got super powerful and came back!

13:08.750 --> 13:10.000
OMG! Talking with her is fun.

13:08.750 --> 13:10.000
The relief after all that tension was crazy!

13:10.000 --> 13:11.080
I hated her so much before, but...

13:10.000 --> 13:11.080
The relief after all that tension was crazy!

13:11.080 --> 13:12.080
I hated her so much before, but...

13:12.080 --> 13:14.670
But how can I?! She's a nerd like me!

13:14.670 --> 13:18.580
Aw, man... I wish I could've gotten a picture of you!

13:18.580 --> 13:21.170
I wanted to get a picture of you, too!

13:23.880 --> 13:24.880
How's this?

13:24.880 --> 13:27.210
Gimme your number, I'll text it to you.

13:27.210 --> 13:29.750
O-okay! Yay, thanks!

13:29.750 --> 13:32.330
Yeah. This feels right.

13:32.750 --> 13:36.330
I love cosplayers. We're all in this together.

13:36.330 --> 13:38.540
She and I are totally gonna be friends.

13:38.540 --> 13:42.080
Hey, Liliel! Can I meet you by the entrance?

13:42.080 --> 13:45.830
Yeah! Sorry, I'll go get changed!

13:45.830 --> 13:47.880
K.... Ka, Kai...

13:48.790 --> 13:50.420
Uh, hello.

13:48.920 --> 13:50.460
<b>Bow...</b>

13:50.790 --> 13:54.960
Is he your, uh... p-photographer?

13:54.960 --> 13:55.920
Yup.

13:56.000 --> 13:58.420
<b>I TAKE THAT BACK</b>

13:58.580 --> 14:01.580
Oh, come on! Grow up, Nagomi!

14:01.580 --> 14:04.330
You know what you have to do!

14:05.170 --> 14:07.330
Hey! Do you wanna cosplay?

14:07.330 --> 14:08.130
Huh?

14:08.130 --> 14:10.000
I love new cosplayers!

14:10.000 --> 14:12.460
We could do a Prince Charming group!
You could be Kai-sama!

14:12.460 --> 14:13.080
Wha?!

14:13.080 --> 14:18.460
So, uh, c-can I have your... Your number?

14:18.580 --> 14:23.630
<b>Women's Changing Room</b>

14:18.920 --> 14:20.790
Uh, s-sure?

14:20.790 --> 14:22.670
YAY!

14:23.710 --> 14:26.380
Feeling hot, huh? You got water?

14:26.380 --> 14:28.130
Yes, I brought some!

14:30.460 --> 14:31.880
She's a canteen girl.

14:33.790 --> 14:37.380
Damn, that crowd you had was awesome!

14:37.380 --> 14:39.500
You're definitely gonna be famous.

14:39.500 --> 14:40.960
How'd it feel?

14:40.960 --> 14:44.330
Oh, man, it was so much fun!

14:44.630 --> 14:48.670
<b>SHE'S SO PRECIOUS</b>

14:44.830 --> 14:47.040
Please stay this way forever!

14:51.580 --> 14:53.170
Eh? No way!

14:58.330 --> 14:59.580
Nagomi-san...

15:03.130 --> 15:07.670
We only had our prep room booked till a certain time,
so we can't use it anymore...

15:07.670 --> 15:11.670
I'm so sorry, but could you go
change in the public changing room?

15:12.540 --> 15:13.880
It's all right.

15:14.380 --> 15:16.540
I'm the one who messed up the schedule.

15:20.750 --> 15:22.750
<b>I don't mean to judge,
but Nagomi's really not that great of a coslpayer.
Ugh, that bitch. I just pretend I don't see her.</b>

15:23.380 --> 15:28.750
I love everyone...
But they don't feel the same.

15:37.420 --> 15:39.380
I'll just get this over with.

15:43.330 --> 15:47.880
I forgot someone helped me get into this...
And I can't reach the zipper!

15:48.330 --> 15:50.040
Should I call Saito to help?

15:50.040 --> 15:51.750
No, I can't have someone come

15:51.750 --> 15:53.380
in here just to help me change,
that'd be so rude!

15:54.750 --> 15:55.880
Stay calm.

15:55.880 --> 15:59.500
Ignore the fact everyone's laughing at you.

16:04.130 --> 16:05.210
Hey...

16:09.750 --> 16:11.250
Do you need help?

16:11.250 --> 16:13.170
Your cosplay is incredible!

16:13.170 --> 16:16.040
I can't believe we get to talk to THE Nagomi-san!

16:19.420 --> 16:21.750
Your Icola is so cute!

16:21.750 --> 16:24.500
You were on this month's CosMedia, right?!

16:24.500 --> 16:27.210
Right on the front cover! I had to get one!

16:27.210 --> 16:28.420
I bought it, too!

16:28.420 --> 16:29.290
Me too!

16:29.290 --> 16:30.210
...Me too!

16:30.210 --> 16:31.500
We love your work!

16:32.540 --> 16:36.170
I thought everyone hated me...

16:37.500 --> 16:39.460
I never though they'd...

16:41.500 --> 16:44.420
That's right. I forgot.

16:45.380 --> 16:49.460
I've been so focused on the horrible comments online.

16:49.830 --> 16:54.290
I forgot that in real life,
no one has ever said anything mean to me.

16:54.540 --> 16:57.420
They've all been nothing but nice to me.

16:57.420 --> 16:57.960
Huh?

16:57.960 --> 16:58.920
Nagomi-chan?!

16:59.960 --> 17:05.920
I can't believe I lied all this time,
saying how much I loved every cosplayer.

17:06.710 --> 17:10.710
How could I, when I never showed that love for myself?

17:11.250 --> 17:17.420
And because I didn't like myself...
I saw everyone as a potential enemy.

17:19.960 --> 17:23.460
I'm sorry, everyone. I'm sorry, Nagomi.

17:24.250 --> 17:25.210
Sorry!

17:25.210 --> 17:29.250
I'm just so relieved to be done, it all came out.
I'm totally fine!

17:29.580 --> 17:30.540
I was worried for a sec!

17:30.540 --> 17:32.130
Are you sure you're okay?

17:32.130 --> 17:34.710
The pressure on pros must be crazy.

17:34.710 --> 17:35.830
I get it.

17:35.830 --> 17:37.500
Girl, you're not even a pro.

17:40.210 --> 17:44.210
I love cosplayers!

17:46.750 --> 17:47.830
Liliel!

17:47.830 --> 17:48.830
Nagomi-san!

17:51.080 --> 17:54.250
You'd better be at Summer Comiket.

17:54.920 --> 17:58.710
I'll be there for work as the most
popular character of the summer.

18:00.580 --> 18:03.500
Okay! I'll be there as Liliel!

18:03.960 --> 18:05.130
Good.

18:05.130 --> 18:08.080
Everyone's saying they want
to get pictures of you there.

18:08.080 --> 18:10.710
Is this from earlier? Wait, 50K shares?!

18:10.710 --> 18:12.420
Huh? Sorry, should I have asked first?

18:12.750 --> 18:15.710
I already uploaded a bunch with you.

18:14.540 --> 18:15.830
<b>Don't know this cosplayer
but she's so freaking cute...!</b>

18:16.750 --> 18:19.420
Why are you surprised?
You saw the crowd around you.

18:20.080 --> 18:22.960
Sooner or later, you're gonna be famous.

18:24.250 --> 18:29.040
That pressure you're feeling is a rite of passage.
Try to enjoy it, yeah?

18:29.960 --> 18:31.460
Don't worry.

18:32.380 --> 18:35.170
If you ever forget the smile on your face today...

18:35.830 --> 18:38.500
I'll return the favor and give
you the reminder you need.

18:52.210 --> 18:53.960
Figures she's exhausted.

18:54.330 --> 18:59.080
Between the crowd of photographers,
and what happened with Sensei and Nagomi...

18:59.080 --> 19:00.710
I'm glad she had a good time.

19:05.040 --> 19:08.210
They probably think we're some cutesy couple.

19:08.750 --> 19:12.790
I'd freak out if she were Liliel,
but she's just Ririsa!

19:21.920 --> 19:25.000
Where are we? Did we miss our stop?

19:25.250 --> 19:26.380
We're good.

19:27.630 --> 19:30.540
I'll keep an eye out. You go back to sleep.

19:35.920 --> 19:37.210
I'll be there for you!

19:38.960 --> 19:44.670
I'm so glad I have him. I don't have to worry.

19:46.290 --> 19:48.460
Whew, it's warm in here.

19:50.080 --> 19:51.000
<b>Cold, so she moved to
a warmer train car</b>

19:51.960 --> 19:53.420
I know those two.

19:54.250 --> 19:55.330
Senpai.

19:56.710 --> 20:00.290
Senpai, I love you so much.

20:00.750 --> 20:03.830
Promise you'll stay with me forever?

20:03.830 --> 20:05.960
O-o-oh my god!

20:07.000 --> 20:09.580
S-s-s-she's using the L word?!

20:09.580 --> 20:12.130
O-Okumura! Hello?!

20:13.460 --> 20:16.330
Yeah, I promise.

20:18.500 --> 20:19.920
Wait, is that Sensei?

20:23.290 --> 20:26.580
S-sorry, I didn't mean to eavesdrop...

20:26.580 --> 20:31.080
I had no idea the two of you were so close.

20:31.380 --> 20:34.130
We are! Especially after the great event
we had with Liliel today!

20:34.130 --> 20:39.330
I'm so proud of her for how perfectly she can
show off her love for Liliel through cosplay!

20:40.210 --> 20:43.330
Please, it's all thanks to your
tremendous support, Senpai!

20:43.330 --> 20:46.040
You're the whole reason I can put
so much energy into cosplay!

20:48.960 --> 20:49.920
See?!

20:48.960 --> 20:49.920
You see?!

20:49.920 --> 20:51.920
We make the best partners!

20:52.710 --> 20:58.960
Oh, they meant something else.
Cosplayer and photographer, I guess.

20:58.960 --> 21:01.750
Christ, though, do they see themselves?

21:02.000 --> 21:04.880
See, this shot of Liliel came out so good!

21:04.880 --> 21:07.880
It did! Great job, Senpai!

21:08.250 --> 21:10.580
Are they sure they're not together?

21:11.790 --> 21:13.460
Man, kids these days...

21:15.380 --> 21:17.790
...I don't get 'em one bit.

21:21.580 --> 21:23.290
Cosplay, you say?

21:23.290 --> 21:25.750
I know how the world at
large might think of cosplay,

21:25.750 --> 21:28.170
but they're putting their hearts into it.

21:28.580 --> 21:31.380
And to do that,
they need a club room.

21:31.380 --> 21:34.580
I'll be their advisor and keep them on track.

21:35.710 --> 21:38.960
Well, this isn't solely my decision to make.

21:39.830 --> 21:46.250
As for whether their activities meet the mark,
I'll let our wonderful student council have their say.

21:46.460 --> 21:48.000
Yeah, sounds about right...

21:48.000 --> 21:53.710
I'm more concerned about whether it's okay
to put this out for the other students to see.

21:55.920 --> 21:57.420
Dude, look at her!

21:55.920 --> 21:57.420
What do you think, Hanyuu-sensei?

21:57.420 --> 21:58.380
Her tits are huge!

21:57.420 --> 21:58.380
What do you think, Hanyuu-sensei?

21:58.380 --> 21:59.250
Her tits are huge!

21:58.380 --> 21:59.250
She's kept this a secret until now, right?

21:59.250 --> 22:00.960
She's kept this a secret until now, right?

22:00.960 --> 22:04.040
Couldn't this stir up some
ruckus amongst the students?

22:07.080 --> 22:10.670
We're supposed to hear back about our report today...

22:10.670 --> 22:11.710
Ririsa!

22:12.830 --> 22:13.580
Mikari-chan?

22:13.580 --> 22:15.540
What the hell is wrong with you?!

22:16.130 --> 22:19.290
You're in big trouble! Just look at the blackboard!

22:23.380 --> 22:24.380
What?

23:56.080 --> 24:00.920
<b>Five Rising Stars</b>
